# HTTP examples for module 03-web-mvc (IntelliJ IDEA HTTP client / VS Code REST Client).
# Start the lesson first: ./mvnw -pl modules/03-web-mvc/lesson -am spring-boot:run

### 3.1 List (page 0, 20 per page, sorted by title)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### 3.4 Paging and sorting
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=1&size=2&sort=price&direction=desc

### 3.1 Get one book (default = version 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 3.5 The same book, version 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
API-Version: 2

### 3.1 + 3.2 Create a book (201 + Location)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"isbn": "978-0-13-235088-4", "title": "Clean Code", "authors": ["Robert C. Martin"], "price": 75.50, "publishedOn": "2008-08-01"}

### 3.2 + 3.3 Invalid input → 400 problem with field errors
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"isbn": "123", "title": "", "authors": [], "price": -5}

### 3.3 Unknown book → 404 problem
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/99

### 3.6 Content negotiation: CSV
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: text/csv

### 3.8 OpenAPI document (UI: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html)
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs

### 3.9 Which thread handled this request?
GET http://localhost:8080/api/runtime/thread
